Description: sign in with a PIN, security key or fingerprint through PAM
 Tux Hello adds Windows Hello-style sign-in to any desktop environment: a
 PIN, a FIDO2 security key or a fingerprint can stand in for the password
 in sudo, polkit prompts and screen lockers. The password always remains
 available as the fallback.
 .
 This package contains the PAM module (pam_tuxhello.so), the tuxhellod
 system daemon, the tuxhello command-line tool and tuxhello-pam-setup, which
 edits the PAM configuration safely and can undo every change.
